# README

After implementing or changing a feature, update `README.md` in the same turn.

- English is the main document.
- Keep a matching Turkish translation under a `# Türkçe` heading at the bottom (after `---`).
- Update Current status / Mevcut durum (and related service sections) so both languages stay in sync.
- Do not add a chat-prompt dump of what the user told Cursor.
